# Task 04: 도메인 뷰 & slug 유틸

## 목적
Prisma 엔티티를 RealWorld 응답 JSON으로 변환하는 순수 함수(`profileView`, `articleView`, `commentView`)와 제목→유일 slug 생성기(`makeSlug`)를 구현한다. DB 접근이 없는 순수 로직이므로 T03과 병렬로 작업 가능하다.

## 선행 태스크
- **T02**: Prisma 모델 필드 형태(아래 입력 타입은 Prisma 반환 형태와 호환).
- (T01의 tsconfig/테스트 하네스 사용)

## 구현 범위 / 대상 파일
- Create: `src/lib/views.ts`, `src/lib/slug.ts`
- Create: `tests/views.test.ts`, `tests/slug.test.ts`

## 이 태스크가 확립하는 인터페이스 (후행 태스크가 의존)
```ts
// src/lib/slug.ts
export function makeSlug(title: string): string

// src/lib/views.ts
type ProfileJSON = { username: string; bio: string | null; image: string | null; following: boolean }
type ArticleJSON = { slug: string; title: string; description: string; body?: string; tagList: string[]; createdAt: string; updatedAt: string; favorited: boolean; favoritesCount: number; author: ProfileJSON }
type CommentJSON = { id: number; createdAt: string; updatedAt: string; body: string; author: ProfileJSON }

export function profileView(user: { username: string; bio: string | null; image: string | null }, following: boolean): { profile: ProfileJSON }
export function articleView(article: { slug: string; title: string; description: string; body: string; createdAt: Date; updatedAt: Date; author: { username: string; bio: string | null; image: string | null }; tags: { name: string }[] }, flags: { favorited: boolean; favoritesCount: number; following: boolean; includeBody?: boolean }): { article: ArticleJSON }
export function commentView(comment: { id: number; body: string; createdAt: Date; updatedAt: Date; author: { username: string; bio: string | null; image: string | null } }, following: boolean): { comment: CommentJSON }
```

## 구현

### Step 1: `src/lib/slug.ts`
```ts
import slugify from 'slugify'
import { randomBytes } from 'node:crypto'

export function makeSlug(title: string): string {
  const base = slugify(title, { lower: true, strict: true }) || 'article'
  const suffix = randomBytes(3).toString('hex') // 6자리 hex → 유일성 보장
  return `${base}-${suffix}`
}
```

### Step 2: `src/lib/views.ts`
```ts
type ProfileJSON = { username: string; bio: string | null; image: string | null; following: boolean }
type ArticleJSON = {
  slug: string; title: string; description: string; body?: string
  tagList: string[]; createdAt: string; updatedAt: string
  favorited: boolean; favoritesCount: number; author: ProfileJSON
}
type CommentJSON = { id: number; createdAt: string; updatedAt: string; body: string; author: ProfileJSON }

type UserLike = { username: string; bio: string | null; image: string | null }

export function profileView(user: UserLike, following: boolean): { profile: ProfileJSON } {
  return { profile: { username: user.username, bio: user.bio, image: user.image, following } }
}

export function articleView(
  article: {
    slug: string; title: string; description: string; body: string
    createdAt: Date; updatedAt: Date
    author: UserLike; tags: { name: string }[]
  },
  flags: { favorited: boolean; favoritesCount: number; following: boolean; includeBody?: boolean },
): { article: ArticleJSON } {
  const out: ArticleJSON = {
    slug: article.slug,
    title: article.title,
    description: article.description,
    tagList: article.tags.map((t) => t.name).sort(),
    createdAt: article.createdAt.toISOString(),
    updatedAt: article.updatedAt.toISOString(),
    favorited: flags.favorited,
    favoritesCount: flags.favoritesCount,
    author: profileView(article.author, flags.following).profile,
  }
  if (flags.includeBody !== false) out.body = article.body
  return { article: out }
}

export function commentView(
  comment: { id: number; body: string; createdAt: Date; updatedAt: Date; author: UserLike },
  following: boolean,
): { comment: CommentJSON } {
  return {
    comment: {
      id: comment.id,
      createdAt: comment.createdAt.toISOString(),
      updatedAt: comment.updatedAt.toISOString(),
      body: comment.body,
      author: profileView(comment.author, following).profile,
    },
  }
}
```
> **주의:** 목록/피드(`includeBody: false`)에서는 `body`가 생략된다. 단일 article 조회/생성/수정에서는 기본값(`includeBody` 미지정 → 포함).

### Step 3: 실패 테스트 — `tests/slug.test.ts`
```ts
import { expect, test } from 'vitest'
import { makeSlug } from '../src/lib/slug.js'

test('makeSlug produces lowercase kebab with unique suffix', () => {
  const a = makeSlug('How to train your Dragon')
  expect(a).toMatch(/^how-to-train-your-dragon-[0-9a-f]{6}$/)
  const b = makeSlug('How to train your Dragon')
  expect(a).not.toBe(b) // 유일성
})

test('makeSlug handles empty/symbol titles', () => {
  expect(makeSlug('!!!')).toMatch(/^article-[0-9a-f]{6}$/)
})
```

### Step 4: 실패 테스트 — `tests/views.test.ts`
```ts
import { expect, test } from 'vitest'
import { profileView, articleView, commentView } from '../src/lib/views.js'

const author = { username: 'jake', bio: 'b', image: null }
const now = new Date('2016-02-18T03:22:56.637Z')

test('profileView shape', () => {
  expect(profileView(author, true)).toEqual({
    profile: { username: 'jake', bio: 'b', image: null, following: true },
  })
})

test('articleView includes body by default, ISO dates, sorted tags', () => {
  const { article } = articleView(
    { slug: 's', title: 't', description: 'd', body: 'B', createdAt: now, updatedAt: now, author, tags: [{ name: 'z' }, { name: 'a' }] },
    { favorited: true, favoritesCount: 3, following: false },
  )
  expect(article.body).toBe('B')
  expect(article.tagList).toEqual(['a', 'z'])
  expect(article.createdAt).toBe('2016-02-18T03:22:56.637Z')
  expect(article.favoritesCount).toBe(3)
  expect(article.author.following).toBe(false)
})

test('articleView omits body when includeBody false', () => {
  const { article } = articleView(
    { slug: 's', title: 't', description: 'd', body: 'B', createdAt: now, updatedAt: now, author, tags: [] },
    { favorited: false, favoritesCount: 0, following: false, includeBody: false },
  )
  expect('body' in article).toBe(false)
})

test('commentView shape', () => {
  const { comment } = commentView({ id: 1, body: 'hi', createdAt: now, updatedAt: now, author }, false)
  expect(comment).toEqual({
    id: 1, createdAt: '2016-02-18T03:22:56.637Z', updatedAt: '2016-02-18T03:22:56.637Z',
    body: 'hi', author: { username: 'jake', bio: 'b', image: null, following: false },
  })
})
```

### Step 5: 테스트 실행
```bash
npm test -- slug views
```
기대: 모두 통과.

### Step 6: 커밋
```bash
git add -A && git commit -m "feat: add view serializers and slug generator"
```

## 완료 기준
- `makeSlug`가 소문자 kebab + 6자리 hex 접미어를 생성하며 호출마다 유일하다.
- `profileView`/`articleView`/`commentView`가 정본 계약(`plan.md`)의 JSON 형태를 정확히 반환한다.
- `articleView`가 `includeBody: false`일 때 `body`를 생략한다.
- 날짜가 ISO 8601 문자열이고 `tagList`가 정렬된다.

## 완료 기록
_(실행 세션이 채움)_

